{"parentUuid":"fde1679f-d7de-4e60-b028-180d881298b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Pm7P1JNrS2qHyXQbS9TJk5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PHP가 실행 자체가 안 되고 있습니다. 두 가지 확인 부탁드립니다.\n\n**1. 블루스퀘어 메인 사이트 작동 확인**\n```\nhttps://bluesquare.kr/\n```\n이게 정상으로 뜨나요?\n\n**2. FTP 업로드 경로 확인**\n\n가비아 FTP에서 `cors-test/` 폴더가 어느 경로에 올라가 있는지 봐주세요. 보통:\n```\n/www/cors-test/          ← 이렇게 있어야 함\n/public_html/cors-test/\n/html/cors-test/\n```\n\n경로가 잘못되면 (`/www/www/cors-test/` 이런 식으로 중첩) Apache가 PHP 없이 503 던집니다."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1481,"cache_read_input_tokens":40872,"output_tokens":699,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1481,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":699,"cache_read_input_tokens":40872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1481,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1481},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaVcWTKnhq9nqMSfVL1eR","type":"assistant","uuid":"e12b500f-6f58-4041-901b-7c78cf916bd3","timestamp":"2026-04-28T05:25:36.627Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\최신프로젝트\\인터파크\\백업\\260427","sessionId":"59c7642a-71bc-4ae8-a885-c0624014856b","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
