{"parentUuid":"36aabf94-14af-4e7c-9b23-5038877dc118","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_017P6pekX5xFAA1m4BYo5MG8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 다음 단계 — KILL_SWITCH 해제 후 fingerprint 확인\n\n---\n\n### 1단계 — 양쪽 config.local.php KILL_SWITCH → false\n\n**블루스퀘어** [config.local.php](cors-test/config.local.php) 수정:\n```php\ndefine('KILL_SWITCH', false);\n```\n\n**놀씨어터** [config.local.noltheater.php](cors-test/config.local.noltheater.php) 수정:\n```php\ndefine('KILL_SWITCH', false);\n```\n\n→ 각각 FTP 업로드 (놀씨어터는 파일명 `config.local.php`로 바꿔서)\n\n---\n\n### 2단계 — fingerprint 양쪽 비교\n\n브라우저에서 각각 열기:\n```\nhttps://bluesquare.kr/cors-test/api/whoami.php\nhttps://www.noltheater-daehakro.com/cors-test/api/whoami.php\n```\n\n응답 JSON에서 `data.fingerprint` 값 확인 → **양쪽 동일한 8자 hex**여야 함.\n\n다르면 `SYNC_SECRET` 불일치 → 다시 맞춰야 합니다.\n\n---\n\n### 3단계 — UI 매트릭스 (fingerprint 일치 확인 후)\n\n```\nhttps://bluesquare.kr/cors-test/ui/\n```\n→ ADMIN_TOKEN `33f2a17510d5429db2562e9536735d8f` 입력 → 저장 → A 시리즈 실행\n\n---\n\n제가 지금 양쪽 파일 `false`로 바꿔드릴까요?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":195,"cache_read_input_tokens":46478,"output_tokens":487,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":195,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":46478,"cache_creation_input_tokens":195,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":195},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaVcvJWe2DH7AVshbVUJH","type":"assistant","uuid":"060d6ead-022d-4ee4-adb1-a642b51f73e3","timestamp":"2026-04-28T05:30:56.484Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\최신프로젝트\\인터파크\\백업\\260427","sessionId":"59c7642a-71bc-4ae8-a885-c06