{"parentUuid":"6861a7b7-e2bb-4962-84a1-eac6675e5f28","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a70b4527-21b5-4b95-bbe0-8da6ec5597c2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - User is running CORS validation tests between two Gabia-hosted domains: bluesquare.kr and www.noltheater-daehakro.com\n   - Needed config.local.php files created for both servers (bluesquare and noltheater versions)\n   - Needed step-by-step deployment and testing guidance\n   - Requested separate deployment folders (deploy-bluesquare/, deploy-noltheater/) for clean FTP uploads\n   - Resolving WAF/Imunify360 blocking issues on Gabia shared hosting\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - PHP 7.4.25 on Gabia shared hosting (fpm-fcgi)\n   - Gabia Imunify360 WAF blocking POST JSON requests with keywords like \"cors\", \"probe\", \"case\"\n   - PHP OPcache caching compiled PHP files, preventing immediate file update reflection\n   - HMAC-SHA256 signed server-to-server communication between peers\n   - KILL_SWITCH mechanism (returns 503 when true)\n   - SYNC_SECRET fingerprint verification (8-char hex, must match on both sides)\n   - Base64 WAF bypass: UI sends `d=<btoa(JSON)>` as form-encoded instead of raw JSON\n   - FTP-based deployment workflow (no git on server)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `deploy-bluesquare/config.local.php`\n     - Bluesquare-specific config, KILL_SWITCH=false\n     - THIS_HOST: bluesquare.kr, PEER_BASE_URL: https://www.noltheater-daehakro.com/cors-test\n     - SYNC_SECRET: `510cab4fa2e011135d277a089e9929652e1b6e51ad2d424c0b09d129d5aa4ce6`\n     - ADMIN_TOKEN: `33f2a17510d5429db2562e9536735d8f`\n     - DB_HOST: 211.47.74.49, DB_NAME: dbusrbluesq0211, DB_USER: usrbluesq0211\n\n   - `deploy-noltheater/config.local.php`\n     - Noltheater-specific config, KILL_SWITCH=false\n     - THIS_HOST: www.noltheater-daehakro.com, PEER_BASE_URL: https://bluesquare.kr/cors-test\n     - Same SYNC_SECRET as bluesquare\n     - ADMIN_TOKEN: `050ba78d8997088152a5d0c3dba9f58b`\n     - DB_HOST: db.usrdaehakro0605.gabia.io, DB_NAME: dbusrdaehakro0605\n\n   - `deploy-bluesquare/api/run.php` and `deploy-noltheater/api/run.php`\n     - Added `// v2` comment at top to bust OPcache\n     - WAF bypass: base64 decode of form-encoded body\n     ```php\n     if (isset($_POST['d'])) {\n         $raw = (string) base64_decode($_POST['d'], true);\n     } elseif (str_starts_with($raw, 'd=')) {\n         parse_str($raw, $pv);\n         $raw = isset($pv['d']) ? (string) base64_decode($pv['d'], true) : $raw;\n     }\n     ```\n     - Renamed outgoing curl headers in peerCallRaw():\n     ```php\n     'User-Agent: PHP/7.4',\n     'X-Sync-Host: ' . (defined('THIS_HOST') ? THIS_HOST : ''),\n     $headers[] = 'X-Sync-Ts: '  . $ts;\n     $headers[] = 'X-Sync-Sig: ' . $sig;\n     ```\n\n   - `deploy-bluesquare/lib/guard.php` and `deploy-noltheater/lib/guard.php`\n     - Updated to read renamed headers:\n     ```php\n     $ts  = headerOrNull('X-Sync-Ts');\n     $sig = headerOrNull('X-Sync-Sig');\n     ```\n\n   - `deploy-bluesquare/ui/index.php` and `deploy-noltheater/ui/index.php`\n     - Added `runFetch()` helper for WAF bypass:\n     ```javascript\n     function runFetch(payload) {\n       return fetch(SELF_BASE + '/api/run.php', {\n         method: 'POST',\n         headers: {'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded', 'X-Admin-Token': getToken()},\n         body: 'd=' + encodeURIComponent(btoa(unescape(encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(payload)))))\n       });\n     }\n     ```\n     - All 4 fetch calls to run.php replaced with `runFetch()`\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Gabia WAF blocking POST JSON**: Imunify360 returned 400 Bad Request on all POST requests. Fixed by base64-encoding payload as form-encoded `d=` field.\n   - **mod_security directives in .htaccess caused 500**: Attempted to add SecFilterEngine Off but Gabia doesn't allow this. Reverted immediately.\n   - **KILL_SWITCH accidentally reset to true**: Local config.local.php had KILL_SWITCH=true; uploading it overwrote server's false value. Fixed by maintaining KILL_SWITCH=false in local deploy folders.\n   - **Server-to-server requests blocked by Bluesquare WAF**: Headers `X-Cors-Test-Ts`, `X-Cors-Test-Host`, `User-Agent: cors-test/1.0` triggered WAF. Renamed to `X-Sync-Ts`, `X-Sync-Host`, `User-Agent: PHP/7.4`.\n   - **OPcache serving old run.php**: Server not reflecting new file content. Added `// v2` comment to force recompile.\n   - **`str_starts_with` used on PHP 7.4**: This function requires PHP 8.0+. May cause issues on PHP 7.4.25 servers (potential unresolved bug).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Bluesquare A1-A7 all ✅ after WAF bypass fix\n   - Noltheater→Bluesquare still getting 400 or missing_auth due to old run.php on servers\n   - OPcache delay preventing new header names from taking effect\n   - Currently waiting for OPcache TTL (60s-5min) after adding `// v2` comment and re-uploading\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"hi\"\n   - \"claude code npm 명령어 줘버ㅘ\"\n   - \"cors-test하려는데 bluesquare어ㅘ nol파일에 각각어떻게 설정하면될지 디ㅔ일하게 알려줘\"\n   - \"config.local.php 이거ㅏ 와꾸 만들어줘 내가 내부 정보는 채울게\"\n   - \"여기에 누구정보 써? 놀씨어터? 아니면 브루?\"\n   - DB credentials from inc/lib/db.php\n   - \"너가 만들어서 붙여ㅑ봐\" (asking to generate and insert secrets)\n   - noltheater DB credentials\n   - \"만들어봐\"\n   - \"자 다시 프로우 줘봐 순서대로 블루스퀘어부터\"\n   - \"https://bluesquare.kr/cors-test/api/whoami.php — Service Unavailable\"\n   - \"아냐 가비아라서 없으면 404 던지는데 이건 다른데? 잘 작동하는거 아냐?\"\n   - whoami.php JSON responses from both servers\n   - \"접속해서 뭐하라고?\" (asking what to do on UI)\n   - A1-A7 all ❌ with SyntaxError HTML response\n   - \"Bad Request — Your browser sent a request that this server could not understand\" with 400 status\n   - \"Service Unavailable\" after .htaccess mod_security change\n   - \"Bad Request Your browser sent a request that this server could not understand. 이건 어케함\"\n   - \"그냥 파일 각각 따로 만들어서 처리해줘 그게 나을듯\"\n   - A series from noltheater all ❌ (status 400)\n   - A7 headers showing X-Cors-Test-Ts (old headers still in use)\n   - \"ㅇㅇ업로드했는데 파일명은 cors-test이긴해ㅔ\"\n   - Bluesquare A results: A1✅ A2❌(401 missing_auth) A3-A4❌ A5✅ A6✅ A7✅\n   - \"cors-test파일 지우고 블루스ㅇ퀘어, 놀씨어터 전용 폴더로 100% 구현되도록 설정\"\n   - \"놀씨어터 다시 ADMIN TOKEN 줘봐\"\n   - Noltheater A1-A7 all ❌ (still 400)\n   - \"아지도 이 오류 뜬다\"\n   - Noltheater A7 request headers showing X-Cors-Test-Ts (old run.php)\n   - \"ㅇㅇ 올라갔느ㅔㄷ ㅗ에ㅐ그러지\" (uploaded but still old)\n   - \"다시 보니까 블루스퀭 ui는...\" — bluesquare A2/A3/A4 failing with missing_auth\n   - \"놀은 아직도 그대로고\"\n   - \"다 했는데도 그러네. 기다리면 최시ㅣㄴ으로 반영되려나?\"\n   - \"2번\" (chose comment-based OPcache bust method)\n   - \"admin 토ㅠ큰 다시 줘버ㅘ\"\n   - \"다 했는데도 그러네. 기다리면 최시ㅣㄴ으로 반영되려나?\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Wait for OPcache TTL (5 minutes) and re-test both UIs\n   - Verify noltheater A series passes after OPcache clears\n   - Verify bluesquare A2/A3/A4 pass after OPcache clears (currently missing_auth because noltheater guard.php expects X-Sync-Ts but bluesquare run.php was sending X-Cors-Test-Ts)\n   - After A series passes on both sides: proceed to file upload test (B series), then C series\n   - **Potential PHP 7.4 bug**: `str_starts_with()` in run.php requires PHP 8.0+ — may need to replace with `strpos($raw, 'd=') === 0`\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Both deploy-bluesquare and deploy-noltheater folders have been updated with `// v2` comment in api/run.php to force OPcache recompile. User uploaded both files to their respective servers. The problem is that the server-side PHP OPcache was still serving the old compiled version of run.php (with X-Cors-Test-Ts headers), causing:\n   - Bluesquare→Noltheater: `missing_auth` (noltheater guard expects X-Sync-Ts, bluesquare sends X-Cors-Test-Ts)\n   - Noltheater→Bluesquare: `400 Bad Request` (WAF blocks X-Cors-Test-* headers)\n\n   Current state: waiting for OPcache to expire (60s–5min).\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   After OPcache clears (wait ~5 minutes), re-run A series on both UIs:\n   - Bluesquare: https://bluesquare.kr/cors-test/ui/ with token `33f2a17510d5429db2562e9536735d8f`\n   - Noltheater: https://www.noltheater-daehakro.com/cors-test/ui/ with token `050ba78d8997088152a5d0c3dba9f58b`\n\n   As the user said: \"다 했는데도 그러네. 기다리면 최시ㅣㄴ으로 반영되려나?\" and the reply was \"네, OPcache TTL이 보통 60초~5분입니다. 5분 기다렸다가 다시 테스트해보세요.\"\n\n   Also need to fix potential PHP 7.4 incompatibility: `str_starts_with()` in run.php should be replaced with `strpos($raw, 'd=') === 0` since both servers run PHP 7.4.25.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: C:\\Users\\nineonelabs003\\.claude\\projects\\d-----------------260427\\59c7642a-71bc-4ae8-a885-c0624014856b.jsonl"},"isVisibleInTranscriptOnly":true,"isCompactSummary":true,"uuid":"4a62dc21-6aa4-44a6-8c1e-def7680def0a","timestamp":"2026-04-28T06:14:06.035Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\최신프로젝트\\인터파크\\백업\\260427","sessionId":"59c7642a-71bc-4ae8-a885-c0624014856b","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"reactive-tumbling-stonebraker"}
